   "user": "O_oNevermore",
   "message": "I have something I want to communicate but I do not yet have the means to communicate it (even to myself)\n\nand it is something I'm passionate about\n\nand my understanding of it changes over time\n\nmy current understanding is that it is an axiological problem at the core of enlightenment culture",
